{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras/f79c3f43e2f4188819515feb39c246c4.avif?t=1772046050\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras_big/f79c3f43e2f4188819515feb39c246c4.avif?t=1772046050 width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Intricate Characters</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Amelia's world, a quiet but defiant average teenager, with an interest in roller skating and photography! Amelia just wants to get home when suddenly she finds herself at the hands of a time travel obsessed scientist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras/c00b9135679867ed7586b0946ecc3b70.avif?t=1772046050\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras_big/c00b9135679867ed7586b0946ecc3b70.avif?t=1772046050 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Narrative Driven Experience</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the story of the time travel scientist Ron, who kidnapped you and discover his compelling back story! Witness how the story unfolds between Ron and Amelia as she attempts her escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras/0e6ddc96e723ae7049aef74d9f34fa1b.avif?t=1772046050\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras_big/0e6ddc96e723ae7049aef74d9f34fa1b.avif?t=1772046050 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore and Solve Immersive Gameplay</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resourcefulness to find your way out of the room by completing the engaging and interactive puzzles. Play the game casually, solving puzzles in any order you like and how you think best! To ultimately find your way back home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras/e31201baf757f7278df1919ad13a55e1.avif?t=1772046050\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/extras_big/e31201baf757f7278df1919ad13a55e1.avif?t=1772046050 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports teleport/snap turn mechanics or analogue stick movement!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263090?t=1772046050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/3c1f67ff11baca8080c0e384044c45dfcf182ffc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772046050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/99359127f407382bf4286ef7dab49816e2dea7be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772046050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263090/99359127f407382bf4286ef7dab49816e2dea7be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772046050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/326309